{title: I know it was the blood}

{comment: Chorus}
I know it was the blood, I know it was the blood
I know it was the blood that saved me
One day when I was lost Jesus died upon the Cross
I know it was the blood for me
Alternative lines
They put stripes upon His back
They beat Him all night long
They put thorns upon His head
They hung Him on the cross
They pierced His hands and feet
They pierced Him in His side
He hung His head and died
They laid Him in a tomb
He rose up from the grave
He’s coming back again
